sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sender (Nub)
    participant R as Receiver (Nub)

    Note over S: build_outgoing(body, reliable=true)<br/>flags |= RELIABLE | HAS_SEQUENCE<br/>seq_id = next_tx_seq++<br/>set bit in 32-bit outstanding-ack bitmap

    S->>R: UDP [flags=0x58, seq_id=N, body]
    Note over S: ACK_TIMEOUT_MS = 700ms timer starts

    alt Ack received within 700ms
        R->>S: UDP [flags=HAS_ACKS]<br/>footer: ack_count=1, ack[0]=N
        Note over S: tick() check_timeouts()<br/>ack N matched — clear bit N<br/>in outstanding-ack bitmap
    else Timeout expires
        Note over S: elapsed >= 700ms<br/>retransmit_count++<br/>added to TickActions.retransmits
        S->>R: retransmit [seq_id=N]
        Note over S: repeats up to MAX_RETRIES=20<br/>strict gt check: retransmit_count > 20
    else Max retries exceeded
        Note over S: retransmit_count > 20<br/>Channel state = Disconnected<br/>added to dead_channels
    end

    Note over S,R: Keepalive: KEEPALIVE_INTERVAL_MS=1000ms<br/>Inactivity timeout: 300,000ms